# Scenograph C2 headed check, run 1 of 2 (FRESH profile): the `>` lane reads
# through Cambium's menu session and command set. Search reaches a command
# that is not kept, and Ctrl+D keeps it. A default (the catalogue's "Fit to
# view") is dropped the same way. The choices are stored by id: a host-owned
# command by its label, a shared verb by its catalogue id. Run 2
# (command_menu_keep_restart.scn) reopens the same TURNSTONE_ROOT.
settle 30
key escape

omnibar actions
type reseed
settle 10
assert snap suggestions ~ Reseed layout
key ctrl+d
settle 5
assert event command-kept Reseed layout
assert snap commands-added == Reseed layout
key escape

omnibar actions
settle 10
assert snap suggestions ~ Back
type fit to
settle 10
assert snap suggestions ~ Fit to view
key ctrl+d
settle 5
assert event command-dropped Fit to view
assert snap commands-removed == view:fit
capture 01_kept_and_dropped
key escape

act Save session
settle 30
log command menu keep receipt complete
